## SQ-CDFW-01 | CD framework counts at boot
@group A
@commands Boot; `grep -n "\[cans\]\|\[food types\]\|\[placeable\]\|\[can servings\]\|\[mortar\]\|genPut\|genMerge" logs/kubejs/startup.log logs/kubejs/server.log \| head -20`; `grep -n "Error occurred while handling event" logs/latest.log \| head`
@pass `[cans] registered N generated cans` (307 on r1120lr); `[food types] ... in 32 types` (food_catalog.md); `[placeable]` counts; `[can servings] N cans` (344 on r1120lr 2026-11-20, after the post-2026-11-01 can additions; less any whose mod is absent); `[mortar] 6 of 6 catalog crafts`; no "no ... member scripts loaded" error
@fails a member script did not load: check its `// requires:` mod id and that the jar loader honors `requires`; rerun `tools/test_gen_members.py`
@reviewed 2026-11-20
# r1120lr batch fault: stale counts (row wanted 31 types and 31x servings); 32 types per food_catalog.md, servings 344 on 2026-11-20
@from batches/r1102b/s3_A.qb
bootexpect \[cans\] registered \d+ generated cans
bootexpect \[food types\] \d+ foods in 32 types
bootexpect \[placeable\]
bootexpect \[can servings\] [1-9]\d\d cans
bootexpect \[mortar\] 6 of 6 catalog crafts
bootreject (?i)no .* member scripts loaded
shell grep -hn "\[cans\]\|\[food types\]\|\[placeable\]\|\[can servings\]\|\[mortar\]\|genPut\|genMerge" logs/kubejs/startup.log logs/kubejs/server.log | head -20; true
look [can servings] is 344 (2026-11-20) less cans of absent mods (rows/SQ-CDFW-01.shell.txt); a different [cans] count after a later generator run is not a fail by itself

## SQ-CDFW-02 | food type, canned source and servings tags unchanged
@group A
@commands `/dumptags item`; compare `creativedelight:food_type/*`, `creativedelight:canned_source`, `creativedelight:cans/servings/*` sizes (moved from `creativeengineering:`, ids follow the owning mod) with `python3 tools/test_gen_members.py` (46 tags, 2724 entries)
@pass same members as before the change (sizes equal to the last dump less items of absent mods)
@fails genMerge lost a part: compare the merged data with the JSON records
@reviewed 2026-11-20
@from batches/r1102b/s3_A.qb
> dumptags item
waitlog \[dumptags\] wrote 600
shell python3 -I $INST/tools/scratch_query/dumpq.py tagdiff $INST/kubejs/exported creativedelight:food_type creativedelight:canned_source creativedelight:cans/servings
look sizes equal to the instance dump (kubejs/exported, 2026-11-19) except items of absent mods and the 2026-11-01 additions (test_gen_members.py: 46 tags, 2724 entries offline)

