@group A
@commands Recipe lookup: `creativedelight:shapeless/*` mortar crafts (create_wheat, create_sugar_cane, farmersdelight rice x2, cocoa powder, garlic clove); craft one canned food and one Canned Goods can, check the Servings line
@pass 6 mortar crafts; cans craft, servings bar and tooltip as before
@fails canning.js / can_tags.js reader
@reviewed 2026-11-20
