## SQ-CDFW-05 | baked durian, baked pear, dried persimmon: one recipe per cooker
@group A
@commands Recipe lookup for outputs Baked Durian, Baked Pear, Dried Persimmon
@pass exactly one furnace, one smoker and one campfire recipe each, all `creativedelight:`, 0.35 xp, 200 / 100 / 600 ticks; no `fruitsdelight:*_smoking` / `*_campfire` left
@fails the family removal does not match a tag input: add id removals or fix `_cook`'s filter
@reviewed 2026-11-20
@from batches/r1102b/s3_A.qb passed
> cdevtest makes fruitsdelight:baked_durian
> cdevtest makes fruitsdelight:baked_pear
> cdevtest makes fruitsdelight:dried_persimmon
expect verb=makes item=fruitsdelight:baked_durian n=3\b
expect verb=makes item=fruitsdelight:baked_pear n=3\b
expect verb=makes item=fruitsdelight:dried_persimmon n=3\b
reject verb=makes id=fruitsdelight:\S*_(smoking|campfire)
count verb=makes id=creativedelight:(smelting|smoking|campfirecooking)/\S+ result=fruitsdelight:(baked_durian|baked_pear|dried_persimmon)\*1 == 9
reject \[cdevtest\] .*done=0

